<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECHS TO TALK TO BOEING, MCDONNELL CSA ON AERO.</title>
<headline>CZECHS TO TALK TO BOEING, MCDONNELL CSA ON AERO.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech government will hold exclusive talks with Boeing Co, McDonnell Douglas and Czech airline Ceske Aerolinie a.s. for a 34-40 percent stake in Czech jet maker Aero Vodochody a.s., Prime Minister Vaclav Klaus said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The interested party with which we will hold talks is the well-known consortium of Boeing Co, McDonnell Douglas and Czech airlines Ceske Aerolinie a.s,&quot; Klaus told a news conference.</p>
</text>
